{"id":"1033b4b7928c3326","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-structured-tree-value-order.md","title":"结构化子树序的外延表示","display":"thm-structured-tree-value-order — 结构化子树序的外延表示","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-structured-tree-value-order","aliases":["72-thm-structured-tree-value-order"],"display":"thm-structured-tree-value-order — 结构化子树序的外延表示","depends_on":["[[72-df-tree-ordinal-extensional-value]]","[[72-cor-structured-subtree-well-order]]","[[72-thm-structured-predecessor-exhaustion]]"],"chapter":"III","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.III Theorem2.8 and Corollary2.9, print155/PDF167; local ordinal-value representation proof","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记","review_2026_10_23":"以显式合取固定两个比较断言的共同量词作用域"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-structured-tree-value-order"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-structured-tree-value-order</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-structured-tree-value-order — 结构化子树序的外延表示"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c9a2f15ef4424ad4\" href=\"?note=c9a2f15ef4424ad4\" title=\"72-df-tree-ordinal-extensional-value\">72-df-tree-ordinal-extensional-value</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"47e3f5d82f726210\" href=\"?note=47e3f5d82f726210\" title=\"72-cor-structured-subtree-well-order\">72-cor-structured-subtree-well-order</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c2a9f766f12bca93\" href=\"?note=c2a9f766f12bca93\" title=\"72-thm-structured-predecessor-exhaustion\">72-thm-structured-predecessor-exhaustion</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"III"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.III Theorem2.8 and Corollary2.9, print155/PDF167; local ordinal-value representation proof"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},{"key":"review_2026_10_23","html":"以显式合取固定两个比较断言的共同量词作用域"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\Omega_s\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\Omega_s\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D^\\prec_\\alpha:=\\{\\beta\\in\\Omega:\\beta\\prec\\alpha\\}\">\\(D^\\prec_\\alpha:=\\{\\beta\\in\\Omega:\\beta\\prec\\alpha\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preccurlyeq\">\\(\\preccurlyeq\\)</span> 是子树关系的自反闭包。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_\\Omega\">\\(v_\\Omega\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c9a2f15ef4424ad4\" href=\"?note=c9a2f15ef4424ad4\" title=\"72-df-tree-ordinal-extensional-value\">72-df-tree-ordinal-extensional-value</a> 的实际序数赋值。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\beta,\\gamma\\in\\{\\delta\\in\\Omega:\\delta\\preccurlyeq\\alpha\\}\\quad\n\\Bigl[\\bigl(\\beta\\prec\\gamma\\Longleftrightarrow v_\\Omega(\\beta)&lt;v_\\Omega(\\gamma)\\bigr)\\land\n\\bigl(v_\\Omega(\\beta)=v_\\Omega(\\gamma)\\Longleftrightarrow\\beta=\\gamma\\bigr)\\Bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\beta,\\gamma\\in\\{\\delta\\in\\Omega:\\delta\\preccurlyeq\\alpha\\}\\quad\n\\Bigl[\\bigl(\\beta\\prec\\gamma\\Longleftrightarrow v_\\Omega(\\beta)&lt;v_\\Omega(\\gamma)\\bigr)\\land\n\\bigl(v_\\Omega(\\beta)=v_\\Omega(\\gamma)\\Longleftrightarrow\\beta=\\gamma\\bigr)\\Bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"v_\\Omega\\!\\upharpoonright D^\\prec_\\alpha:D^\\prec_\\alpha\\overset{\\cong}{\\longrightarrow}v_\\Omega(\\alpha).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[v_\\Omega\\!\\upharpoonright D^\\prec_\\alpha:D^\\prec_\\alpha\\overset{\\cong}{\\longrightarrow}v_\\Omega(\\alpha).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对结构化 α 同时归纳。零分支为空；后继分支在旧子树良序的顶端添一个前驱，外延值也添一。极限分支的直接子树严格递增，且全部严格子树由这些直接子树及其前驱穷尽；归纳假设把这些嵌套初段分别表示为相应序数初段，取并恰为其上确界。故限制映射满到 vΩ(α)、单射且保序反序。比较范围必须在同一结构化树以下；上一例的 λ 与 μ 不在同一这样的子树链中，不能套用单射性。</p>\n<p>2026-10-23：原比较域与数学结论保留；将并列逗号改为方括号内的合取，使 β、γ 对两个等价式都受同一全称量词绑定，避免第二式的作用域依赖排版阅读。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-tree-ordinal-extensional-value","status":"resolved","id":"c9a2f15ef4424ad4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-tree-ordinal-extensional-value]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-cor-structured-subtree-well-order","status":"resolved","id":"47e3f5d82f726210","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-cor-structured-subtree-well-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-structured-predecessor-exhaustion","status":"resolved","id":"c2a9f766f12bca93","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-structured-predecessor-exhaustion]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-tree-ordinal-extensional-value","status":"resolved","id":"c9a2f15ef4424ad4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha\\in\\Omega_s$，$D^\\prec_\\alpha:=\\{\\beta\\in\\Omega:\\beta\\prec\\alpha\\}$；$\\preccurlyeq$ 是子树关系的自反闭包。$v_\\Omega$ 为 [[72-df-tree-ordinal-extensional-value]] 的实际序数赋值。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\Omega_s","display":false},{"tex":"D^\\prec_\\alpha:=\\{\\beta\\in\\Omega:\\beta\\prec\\alpha\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\preccurlyeq","display":false},{"tex":"v_\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall\\beta,\\gamma\\in\\{\\delta\\in\\Omega:\\delta\\preccurlyeq\\alpha\\}\\quad\n\\Bigl[\\bigl(\\beta\\prec\\gamma\\Longleftrightarrow v_\\Omega(\\beta)<v_\\Omega(\\gamma)\\bigr)\\land\n\\bigl(v_\\Omega(\\beta)=v_\\Omega(\\gamma)\\Longleftrightarrow\\beta=\\gamma\\bigr)\\Bigr].","display":true},{"tex":"v_\\Omega\\!\\upharpoonright D^\\prec_\\alpha:D^\\prec_\\alpha\\overset{\\cong}{\\longrightarrow}v_\\Omega(\\alpha).","display":true}],"bytes":2325,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-55","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"III章新增5项：[[72-df-tree-ordinal-extensional-value]] · [[72-ex-equal-ordinals-different-hierarchies]] · [[72-ex-tree-value-nonstrict]] · [[72-lem-tree-value-arithmetic]] · [[72-thm-structured-tree-value-order]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-51","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"III章新增5项：[[72-df-tree-ordinal-extensional-value]] · [[72-ex-equal-ordinals-different-hierarchies]] · [[72-ex-tree-value-nonstrict]] · [[72-lem-tree-value-arithmetic]] · [[72-thm-structured-tree-value-order]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-51","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"III章新增5项：[[72-df-tree-ordinal-extensional-value]] · [[72-ex-equal-ordinals-different-hierarchies]] · [[72-ex-tree-value-nonstrict]] · [[72-lem-tree-value-arithmetic]] · [[72-thm-structured-tree-value-order]]"}],"outgoing":["c9a2f15ef4424ad4","47e3f5d82f726210","c2a9f766f12bca93"]}